o was voiced by Guy Harris, the Voiceover Guy. This was a soft voiceover style and it worked out really well. Find out more!\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Explainer Video Voiceover for myDPD"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Another day, another great explainer video</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Football Commentator - Turkish Air","aria-label":"Previous: Football Commentator - Turkish Air","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/breda-university-of-applied-sciences-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Breda University Commercials","aria-label":"Next: Breda University Commercials","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>An explainer video with a softer style</h2>\r\n<p>I've done so many <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> that I've lost count. They're a great way to take a little more time and care to describe your product to your target audience. As a voiceover artist, explainer videos are distilled communication, as their main purpose is to offer as much information as possible in a short timeframe. That's exactly what the myDPD script achieved and I decided that a softer voiceover style would be a good fit here. If you'd like a few more explainer video examples, check out my <a href=\"/wirecard-male-voice-over\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Wirecard\">Wirecard</a>, and <a href=\"/batelco-wifi-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Batelco\">Batelco</a> videos.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/amc6e6-6YzA","title":"Explainer Video Voiceover for myDPD","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/my-dpd-explainer-voice-over.jpg","alt":"my-dpd-explainer-voice-over","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Explainer Video Voiceover for myDPD"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about DPD</h2>\r\n<p>You probably don't need me to tell you much about <a href=\"https://www.dpd.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"DPD\">DPD</a>, as it's one of the largest shipping, currier, and delivery companies in the world. However, I like to write a little bit about all of the companies I work with, so indulge me, you might even learn something new! Based in Germany, DPD ships all over the world and it has a reputation for efficiency and reliability. <a href=\"https://www.dpd.co.uk/content/my_dpd/index.jsp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"MyDPD\">myDPD</a> was the topic of the explainer video and it is a specific, personal service for account holders that brings alll of your shipping needs and proceedures together into one neat and convenient platform.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch with me</h2>\r\n<p>If you're working on an explainer video like this one for DPD, or if you're working on a shorter <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> and you're looking for a similar voiceover style, please feel free to <a href=\"/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I am always happy to work with new companies and I'm sure I'll have the right voiceover style for you in my repertoire of voices and <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">characters</a>. If you need a little more convincing, I am more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script. This way, you can hear whether or not I'm right for your project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Explainer Video Voiceover for myDPD","pageUrl":"my-dpd-explainer-voice-over"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","536",{"href":"/spiderman-car-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/spiderman-car-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Spiderman Car Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Spiderman Car Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","749",{"href":"/horizon-zero-dawn-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/horizon-zer